#: manual/tutorial/research_rewrite.md:3
msgid "This tutorial runs the rewriting prototype of the `research_rewrite` package: rewrite one subterm with a local equation, check the recorded replay obligation, and simplify a connective application. The package is research-only and not part of the shipped prover, so use it to experiment, not to build on."
msgstr ""

